<title>USA: Metropolitan Asset increases shares.</title>
<headline>Metropolitan Asset increases shares.</headline>
<dateline>DAYTON, Ohio 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Metropolitan Asset Management Co said on Tuesday that its board had approved an increase in authorized common shares to 100 million from six million.</p>
<p>The increase was approved on October 25, prior to Metropolitan's merger with Diamond Laser International, said Kenneth Wiseman, the company's treasurer.</p>
<p>Metropolitan Asset presently has almost 12 million shares outstanding, following the issuance of new shares from the merger, Wiseman said.</p>
